		= \E_x \sum_a \bra{\psi} (A^x_a - B^x_a)^\dagger \Bigl( \sum_{g\,:\,g(x)=a} (S^x_g)^\dagger S^x_g \Bigr) (A^x_a - B^x_a) \ket{\psi}\,.
